# Zamvar Capital — Fund 1 · environment keys
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit real keys.
# 5-minute latency is acceptable everywhere — delayed/EOD tiers are fine.

# ── NEEDED NOW (primary data inflow) ─────────────────────────────
# Financial Modeling Prep — earnings calendar, quotes, fundamentals,
# cash runway, float/shares, short interest.
# Free tier = 250 req/day (testing only); paid "Starter" for a real ~20-name daily refresh.
# https://site.financialmodelingprep.com/developer/docs
FMP_API_KEY=

# ── FREE, NO KEY ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ClinicalTrials.gov API v2 — trial readouts. No auth required. (no var needed)

# ── OPTIONAL / LATER ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Polygon.io — options implied-move / IV. Only needed for due-diligence (Phase 5-6).
# POLYGON_API_KEY=
#
# Gemini/Google — OPTIONAL: better analog-search embeddings + Graphify semantic extraction.
# The KB works without it (local deterministic embedder).
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# ── EXECUTION-TIME ONLY (Phase 11, live trading — last) ──────────
# Robinhood official agentic-trading account is connected by URL + localhost OAuth
# at go-live (not an env key here). Provides quotes + order placement.
#
# Anthropic — needed only when the desk runs HEADLESS on a schedule
# (Claude Agent SDK, Phase 4+). Not required while agents run inside Claude Code.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ── MANUAL DATA (no key) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# PDUFA / AdCom dates have no free API — hand-curate into data/pdufa_curated.csv
# (see data/README.md). Optionally seed from a paid tracker (e.g. BPIQ).
